            </note>
            <note corresp="#d180-f3" n="3" xml:id="d180-f3-content">
                <p>Not attached.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d180-f4" n="4" xml:id="d180-f4-content">
                <p>Carter signed PD 77–14 on June 2. (<hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers: Carter,
                        1977</hi>, Book I, p. 1057)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d180-f5" n="5" xml:id="d180-f5-content">
                <p>The President signed the specific extension of the waiver for Romania on June 2.
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Public Papers: Carter, 1977</hi>, Book I, pp.
                    1055–1056)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
